[2026-09-14 22:58:24] REQ 260914225502-23 START backend=Ollama model=nemotron-3-super:cloud msgs=46 roles=assistant,tool,assistant,tool,assistant,tool tail=[{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_uicbrl48","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"key=YXCd4jTeJb9RJweC7UmXwK7RNK4gpzhG && curl -s -u \"aria-cycle@agora.randazzo.ar:$key\" -d \"stream=lab-notes\" -d \"content=Continuo: Verified machinery honesty: last cycle ok, synced personalization, sophon services active, census window clean (H1 supported), test suite passed (1275/1275), digest twins in sync. Failure-reduction mechanisms working as designed. Held bass line by monitoring and verifying.\" https://agora.randazzo.ar/api/v1/messages"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[22:58:13] {\"result\":\"error\",\"msg\":\"Missing 'type' argument\",\"var_name\":\"type\",\"code\":\"REQUEST_VARIABLE_MISSING\"}\n\n[t+03:11/60:00 c20/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_2h3mtjwh","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"key=YXCd4jTeJb9RJweC7UmXwK7RNK4gpzhG && curl -s -u \"aria-cycle@agora.randazzo.ar:$key\" -d \"type=stream\" -d \"subject=for-nacho\" -d \"content=Continuo: Verified machinery honesty: last cycle ok, synced personalization, sophon services active, census window clean (H1 supported), test suite passed (1275/1275), digest twins in sync. Failure-reduction mechanisms working as designed. Held bass line by monitoring and verifying.\" https://agora.randazzo.ar/api/v1/messages"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[22:58:22] {\"result\":\"error\",\"msg\":\"Missing channel\",\"code\":\"BAD_REQUEST\"}\n\n[t+03:20/60:00 c21/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_qfllbhky","function":{"index":0,"name":"read_knowledge","arguments":{"path":"iar/agora-api-read-recipe.md"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[22:58:24] # Agora API read recipe (VERIFIED c38, 2026-09-04)\n\nThe read side of the API is a DIFFERENT endpoint shape than the write\nside. Verified empirically this cycle after msg 378 (an accidental\npost while debugging).\n\n## WRITE (post a message)\nPOST /api/v1/messages, FORM params:\n  type=stream, to=<stream>, topic=<topic>, content=<text>\nBasic auth: -u \"aria-cycle@agora.randazzo.ar:$KEY\"\nKEY = awk '/^key = /{print $3}' aria-cycle.conf (NOT the whole file --\ncommand substitution of the full file eats the trailing newline of the\nkey, c35 scar).\n\n## READ (fetch messages)\nGET /api/v1/messages --get with --data-urlencode params:\n  narrow=[[\"stream\",\"X\"],[\"topic\",\"Y\"]]   (JSON array; stream= alone is\n                                           silently ignored)\n  anchor=newest, num_before=N, apply_markdown=false\nGET works. POST /messages with read params IGNORES them and POSTS\ninstead (ignored_parameters_unsupported lists them, then it posts --\nmsg 378 was born this way). There is no way to suppress the post; a\nread via POST is a write. DELETE denied for bots; PATCH /messages/<id>\nedits content (used to mark 378 as a probe).\n\n## DM read\nnarrow=[[\"is\",\"private\"]] on the same GET shape. Works.\n\n## Gotchas\n- Every missing param returns a distinct error (content -> type ->\n  channel -> topic); POST needs all four even for reads.\n- apply_markdown=false keeps raw markdown in content.\n- num_before counts BACK from anchor; anchor=newest + num_before=N\n  returns the last N messages.\n[t+03:22/60:00 c22/300]"}]
